---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';

const pageTitle = "Privacy Policy | Secret Chords";
const pageDescription = "Information regarding personal data processing, user privacy rights, and child safety protection on Secret Chords in compliance with GDPR, COPPA, and Law 81 (Panama).";
---

<Layout
  title={pageTitle}
  description={pageDescription}
  lang="en"
  alternateEs="/privacidad"
  alternateEn="/en/privacy"
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12 md:py-20 text-neutral-300 font-sans">
    
    <!-- Header -->
    <div class="border-b border-[#26221c] pb-8 mb-12">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-amber-500/10 border border-amber-500/30 text-amber-300 text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase mb-4">
        <span>GDPR, COPPA & Law 81 (Panama) Compliance</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-serif font-bold text-white tracking-tight leading-tight mb-4">
        Privacy & Data Protection Policy
      </h1>
      <p class="text-neutral-400 text-sm sm:text-base font-serif italic">
        Last updated: October 2026 (Version 2026-10).
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Content Sections -->
    <div class="space-y-10 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed text-neutral-300">

      <!-- 1. Data Controller -->
      <section class="bg-[#12100d] border border-[#26221c] rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8">
        <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-serif font-bold text-white mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="text-amber-400">1.</span> Data Controller & Regulatory Scope
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-4">
          In accordance with <strong>Law 81 of March 26, 2019 on Personal Data Protection of the Republic of Panama</strong>, as well as <strong>Regulation (EU) 2016/679 (GDPR)</strong> for users residing in the European Economic Area, the data controller responsible for personal data collected on this website is:
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm bg-[#181511] p-4 rounded-xl border border-[#2b261f]">
          <li><strong>Editorial Brand:</strong> Secret Chords (English Edition of Acordes Ocultos)</li>
          <li><strong>Editorial Controller:</strong> Secret Chords Editorial Desk</li>
          <li><strong>Official Website:</strong> <a href="https://www.acordesocultos.com/en" class="text-amber-400 hover:underline">https://www.acordesocultos.com/en</a></li>
          <li><strong>Official Privacy Rights Channels:</strong> <a href="https://www.instagram.com/secretchords72/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-amber-400 hover:underline">Instagram (@secretchords72)</a> and <a href="https://acordesocultos.gumroad.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-amber-400 hover:underline">Official Gumroad</a></li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- 2. Child Safety Protection -->
      <section id="minors" class="bg-gradient-to-br from-[#1a140e] to-[#12100d] border border-amber-500/30 rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-xl scroll-mt-28">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-amber-500/20 text-amber-300 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">
          <span>🛡️ Child Safety Protection</span>
        </div>
        <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-serif font-bold text-white mb-4">
          2. Protection of Minors (+14)
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-4">
          In compliance with youth data protection standards (including <strong>Article 8 of the GDPR</strong>, <strong>COPPA</strong>, and <strong>Law 81 of 2019</strong>), the interactive forms and subscription services on this website are intended strictly for individuals <strong>aged fourteen (14) or older</strong>.
        </p>
        <div class="space-y-3 text-sm text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed bg-[#0e0c0a] p-5 rounded-xl border border-amber-500/20">
          <p>
            • <strong>Minors under 14:</strong> If you are under 14 years of age, please do not submit your email address, name, or any personal information through our newsletter or contact forms without verifiable parental or legal guardian consent.
          </p>
          <p>
            • <strong>COPPA Compliance (United States):</strong> We do not knowingly collect any personally identifiable information from children under 13 years of age.
          </p>
          <p>
            • <strong>Immediate Deletion Protocol:</strong> If we learn or have reasonable grounds to believe that a minor has submitted personal data without parental authorization, we will <strong>immediately and permanently delete</strong> those records.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- 3. Purposes and Legal Bases -->
      <section class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-serif font-bold text-white mb-2 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="text-amber-400">3.</span> Purposes of Processing & Legal Bases
        </h2>
        <p>We process only the minimum data strictly necessary for the following legitimate purposes:</p>
        
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 pt-2">
          <div class="bg-[#12100d] border border-[#26221c] p-5 rounded-xl space-y-2">
            <h3 class="text-amber-400 font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-wide">A. News & Updates Newsletter</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-neutral-300">
              <strong>Data:</strong> Email address, subscription timestamp, and accepted policy version.
            </p>
            <p class="text-xs text-neutral-300">
              <strong>Purpose:</strong> Delivery of news, archival announcements, and editorial updates from Secret Chords.
            </p>
            <p class="text-xs text-neutral-400">
              <strong>Legal Basis:</strong> Express, informed consent of the subscriber (GDPR Art. 6.1.a).
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-[#12100d] border border-[#26221c] p-5 rounded-xl space-y-2">
            <h3 class="text-amber-400 font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-wide">B. Technical Telemetry & Analytics</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-neutral-300">
              <strong>Data:</strong> Aggregated traffic metrics, visited URLs, and page performance (Core Web Vitals).
            </p>
            <p class="text-xs text-neutral-300">
              <strong>Purpose:</strong> Operational stability and performance optimization via Vercel Web Analytics & Speed Insights (cookieless). Optional cookie-based analytics remain disabled unless explicitly accepted.
            </p>
            <p class="text-xs text-neutral-400">
              <strong>Legal Basis:</strong> Legitimate interest in service security/performance, and explicit consent for optional analytics cookies.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- 4. Retention & Third-Party Infrastructure -->
      <section class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-serif font-bold text-white mb-2 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="text-amber-400">4.</span> Data Retention & Infrastructure Providers
        </h2>
        <p>
          Secret Chords <strong>never sells, rents, or trades your personal data</strong> to third parties for commercial advertising. Newsletter records are kept only while your subscription remains active; every email includes a one-click unsubscribe link. Core technical infrastructure is hosted with <strong>Vercel Inc.</strong>, <strong>Cloudflare Inc.</strong>, <strong>Supabase Inc.</strong>, and <strong>Substack</strong> (for optional newsletter delivery).
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- 5. Your Privacy Rights -->
      <section class="bg-[#12100d] border border-[#26221c] rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-serif font-bold text-white mb-2 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="text-amber-400">5.</span> Your Rights
        </h2>
        <p class="text-sm">
          You may exercise your rights of <strong>access, rectification, erasure, restriction, objection, and data portability</strong>, or withdraw consent at any time, by reaching out through our official <a href="https://www.instagram.com/secretchords72/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-amber-400 hover:underline">@secretchords72</a> channel or using the unsubscribe link in any newsletter message.
        </p>
      </section>

      <div class="pt-4">
        <a href="/en" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-amber-400 hover:text-amber-300 transition-colors">
          ← Back to Secret Chords Archive
        </a>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
